PARTICIPATION

Article 30

1. Every person may participate in the implementation of the Protection of Women in the Region.
2. Participation as referred to in paragraph (1) is carried out by individuals, groups or community social organizations, non-governmental organizations, educational institutions, Law Enforcement Institutions, service institutions, religious institutions, Islamic boarding schools, professional organizations, legal aid organizations, youth organizations, broadcasting supervisory institutions, media, communities, professional institutions, the business sector and other related stakeholders.
